<div id="text-29f17637da" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Macquarie Asset Management (MAM)</h3>
<p>Connecting the world’s capital with investment opportunities, Macquarie Asset Management combines a long-term perspective with deep sector expertise to generate positive outcomes for clients, portfolio companies and communities.</p>

