<div id="text-7856cf362d" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Our central service groups</h3>
<p>The central service groups provide a range of functions supporting the operating groups, ensuring they have the appropriate workplace support and systems to operate effectively and the necessary resources to meet their regulatory, compliance, financial, legal and risk management requirements.</p>

