                    <h2 class="cmp-tile-fact__heading">
                      <span class="cmp-tile-fact__heading-text">
                          Financial Management, People and Engagement (FPE)
                      </span>
                    </h2>
                
                <div class="cmp-tile-fact__description">
                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-f633a0d781" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Responsible for managing the Group’s financial, tax and treasury activities and strategic priorities, fostering our culture through people and community engagement, and engaging with stakeholders to protect and promote Macquarie’s reputation globally.</p>

</div>

    


