    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-c7927b68cf" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Leadership and Corporate Governance</h3>
<h4>Board of Directors</h4>
<p>The primary role of the Board of Directors is to promote the long-term interests of Macquarie, taking into account the specific and broader responsibilities to our shareholders, funders, clients, employees, and the communities in which we operate.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta aem-GridColumn--small--none aem-GridColumn--offset--xsmall--0 aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn--xsmall--12 aem-GridColumn--xsmall--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--small--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--small--0 aem-GridColumn--default--6 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--primary cmp-cta--long light blue  p2" href="/uk/en/about/company/board-of-directors.html" target="_self" title="Meet the Board of Directors">
        
        
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">Meet the Board of Directors</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>
<div class="colour-block aem-GridColumn--offset--xsmall--0 aem-GridColumn--xsmall--12 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--xsmall--hide"><div class="my-width-full colour-block colour-block-white-white margin-bottom-minus-16 dark-text" data-component="true">
    <div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    
    
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-55c5b9d1f9" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>Executive Committee</h4>
<p>The Executive Committee is appointed by the Board and comprises the Chief Executive Officer, Chief Financial Officer, Chief Risk Officer, Chief Operating Officer, Group General Counsel, CEO of Macquarie Bank Limited and heads of each of the operating groups.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta aem-GridColumn--small--none aem-GridColumn--offset--xsmall--0 aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn--xsmall--12 aem-GridColumn--xsmall--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--small--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--small--0 aem-GridColumn--default--6 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--primary cmp-cta--long light blue  p2" href="/uk/en/about/company/executive-committee.html" target="_self" title="Meet the Executive Committee">
        
        
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">Meet the Executive Committee</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>
<div class="colour-block aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="my-width-full colour-block  dark-text" data-component="true">
    <div class="responsivegrid">


