        <div class="content-block">
            <div class="content-block__text">
                
                    <h2 class="cmp-tile-fact__heading">
                      <span class="cmp-tile-fact__heading-text">
                          Risk Management
                      </span>
                    </h2>
                
                <div class="cmp-tile-fact__description">
                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-db166aa090" class="cmp-text">
    <p>An independent and centralised function responsible for independent and objective review and challenge, oversight, monitoring and reporting in relation to Macquarie’s material risks. RMG designs and oversees the implementation of the risk management framework.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
